Have to enable sound in the kernel to get it to work.  After that mpg123
should work right off the bat - mine did..  Here's what to look for in
there:
wss*   at      isa? port 0x530 irq 9 drq 0     # Windows SoundSystem
audio* at      wss?

-Linc.

